{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wyq4duf9DYwJWPbdEgoo4D","type":"tool_result","content":"850\t\n851\t<h3>房型与价格</h3>\n852\t<ul>\n853\t  <li><strong>混合宿舍（Mixed Dorm）</strong>：每晚 RM37.80（含旅游税），月租 RM594</li>\n854\t  <li><strong>女生专用宿舍（Female Dorm）</strong>：同等价格，环境更安全私密</li>\n855\t  <li>所有床位均为日式胶囊设计，配备高密度记忆棉床垫</li>\n856\t</ul>\n857\t\n858\t<h3>设施一览</h3>\n859\t<ul>\n860\t  <li>免费高速 WiFi（全区覆盖）</li>\n861\t  <li>24小时出入，无宵禁</li>\n862\t  <li>冷气空调（独立温控）</li>\n863\t  <li>个人储物柜（附锁）</li>\n864\t  <li>共用厨房（可自行烹饪）</li>\n865\t  <li>热水淋浴（含沐浴露和洗发水）</li>\n866\t  <li>毛巾提供</li>\n867\t  <li>洗衣服务：RM5/次</li>\n868\t  <li>24小时闭路电视保安</li>\n869\t</ul>\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6da17fb6-3289-4255-a288-226ac7439267","uuid":"83b4c9c0-af7d-4394-aaaf-dee777901279","timestamp":"2026-04-14T09:33:27.035Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src/data/blog/posts.ts","content":"\n<h3>房型与价格</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>混合宿舍（Mixed Dorm）</strong>：每晚 RM37.80（含旅游税），月租 RM594</li>\n  <li><strong>女生专用宿舍（Female Dorm）</strong>：同等价格，环境更安全私密</li>\n  <li>所有床位均为日式胶囊设计，配备高密度记忆棉床垫</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>设施一览</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>免费高速 WiFi（全区覆盖）</li>\n  <li>24小时出入，无宵禁</li>\n  <li>冷气空调（独立温控）</li>\n  <li>个人储物柜（附锁）</li>\n  <li>共用厨房（可自行烹饪）</li>\n  <li>热水淋浴（含沐浴露和洗发水）</li>\n  <li>毛巾提供</li>\n  <li>洗衣服务：RM5/次</li>\n  <li>24小时闭路电视保安</li>\n</ul>","numLines":20,"startLine":850,"totalLines":1100}}}
