{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013BpcJLzuLpUEezrEUa54Yt","type":"tool_result","content":"1050\t<p>Peak hours (12–2 pm, 5–8 pm) offer 1.5–2x surge pricing. Full-time drivers: RM200–300/day. Part-time: RM100–150/evening.</p>\n1051\t\n1052\t<h2>Vehicle & Document Requirements</h2>\n1053\t<p>To register, you'll need:</p>\n1054\t<ul>\n1055\t  <li>Valid driver's license and vehicle registration (current roadtax)</li>\n1056\t  <li>Insurance certificate (third-party or comprehensive)</li>\n1057\t  <li>Photos: License, registration, insurance, vehicle (exterior + interior), selfie with ID</li>\n1058\t  <li>Malaysian bank account for payouts</li>\n1059\t</ul>\n1060\t\n1061\t<h2>5-Step Registration Process</h2>\n1062\t<p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Download Lalamove Driver app → \"Sign up as driver\" → Enter Malaysian ID and phone number.</p>\n1063\t<p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Upload clear photos of all documents (license, registration, insurance).</p>\n1064\t<p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Lalamove calls to verify your identity and bank details.</p>\n1065\t<p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Vehicle inspection (usually photo-based in JB; in-person if requested).</p>\n1066\t<p><strong>Step 5:</strong> Approval in 3–5 days → Go live and accept jobs.</p>\n1067\t\n1068\t<h2>Why Lalamove?</h2>\n1069\t<p><strong>Flexibility:</strong> 24/7 availability, no shift requirements, no boss. Accept 2 jobs or 20 — your choice.</p>\n1070\t<p><strong>Keep Your Earnings:</strong> Lalamove's 15–20% platform fee is transparent. No hidden deductions.</p>\n1071\t<p><strong>Cross-Border Demand:</strong> JB's proximity to Singapore creates high demand for parcels and documents (RM50–80 for long deliveries).</p>\n1072\t\n1073\t<h2>Lalamove vs. Foodpanda vs. Grab</h2>\n1074\t<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0\">\n1075\t<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0.5rem\">Platform</th><th style=\"padding:0.5rem\">RM/Job</th><th style=\"padding:0.5rem\">Focus</th></tr>\n1076\t<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\"><strong>Lalamove</strong></td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">25–80</td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">General parcels, logistics</td></tr>\n1077\t<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\"><strong>Foodpanda</strong></td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">15–40</td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">Food delivery</td></tr>\n1078\t<tr><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\"><strong>Grab</strong></td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">20–50</td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">Rides + parcels</td></tr>\n1079\t</table>\n1080\t\n1081\t<p><strong>Lalamove wins:</strong> Highest payouts. No restaurant partnership needed — any customer, any parcel.</p>\n1082\t<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Many drivers work all three platforms. Lalamove mornings, Foodpanda lunch, Grab evenings = maximized income.</p>\n1083\t\n1084\t<h2>Start Today</h2>\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6da17fb6-3289-4255-a288-226ac7439267","uuid":"607276ed-4582-4762-ba14-df551b98ef0f","timestamp":"2026-04-14T09:33:39.877Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\data\\blog\\posts.ts","content":"<p>Peak hours (12–2 pm, 5–8 pm) offer 1.5–2x surge pricing. Full-time drivers: RM200–300/day. Part-time: RM100–150/evening.</p>\n\n<h2>Vehicle & Document Requirements</h2>\n<p>To register, you'll need:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Valid driver's license and vehicle registration (current roadtax)</li>\n  <li>Insurance certificate (third-party or comprehensive)</li>\n  <li>Photos: License, registration, insurance, vehicle (exterior + interior), selfie with ID</li>\n  <li>Malaysian bank account for payouts</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>5-Step Registration Process</h2>\n<p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Download Lalamove Driver app → \"Sign up as driver\" → Enter Malaysian ID and phone number.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Upload clear photos of all documents (license, registration, insurance).</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Lalamove calls to verify your identity and bank details.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Vehicle inspection (usually photo-based in JB; in-person if requested).</p>\n<p><strong>Step 5:</strong> Approval in 3–5 days → Go live and accept jobs.</p>\n\n<h2>Why Lalamove?</h2>\n<p><strong>Flexibility:</strong> 24/7 availability, no shift requirements, no boss. Accept 2 jobs or 20 — your choice.</p>\n<p><strong>Keep Your Earnings:</strong> Lalamove's 15–20% platform fee is transparent. No hidden deductions.</p>\n<p><strong>Cross-Border Demand:</strong> JB's proximity to Singapore creates high demand for parcels and documents (RM50–80 for long deliveries).</p>\n\n<h2>Lalamove vs. Foodpanda vs. Grab</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0\">\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:0.5rem\">Platform</th><th style=\"padding:0.5rem\">RM/Job</th><th style=\"padding:0.5rem\">Focus</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\"><strong>Lalamove</strong></td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">25–80</td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">General parcels, logistics</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\"><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\"><strong>Foodpanda</strong></td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">15–40</td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">Food delivery</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\"><strong>Grab</strong></td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">20–50</td><td style=\"padding:0.5rem\">Rides + parcels</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p><strong>Lalamove wins:</strong> Highest payouts. No restaurant partnership needed — any customer, any parcel.</p>\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Many drivers work all three platforms. Lalamove mornings, Foodpanda lunch, Grab evenings = maximized income.</p>\n\n<h2>Start Today</h2>","numLines":35,"startLine":1050,"totalLines":1100}}}
